# Who may connect to {{.Instance}} (spec 0014). The local socket is the image's own, inside the
# container; every connection over the network signs in with a password{{if .Uses.tls.Bound}} over TLS{{end}}.
local all all trust
{{- if .Uses.tls.Bound}}
hostssl all all all scram-sha-256
{{- else}}
host all all all scram-sha-256
{{- end}}
